- * walking - and which otherwise takes two key presses and two remembered
- * numbers to answer. That ambiguity is what prompted this: a tester could
- * not tell whether the distance was falling or the feature was stuck.
- *
- * The milestones and their hysteresis live in the shared library
- * (ETA_NavigationSystem_UpdateApproach), so both integrations announce at
- * the same points; this only supplies the distance and says when the
- * target changed.
- *
- * Reset on a change of objective because distance to a different
